See COPYING.CC_BY-SA_3.0 and https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/.
No Lensfun C/C++ library or lensfunpy package is linked or redistributed.

Original XML is retained. OpenLR's generated lens-data.js is an adaptation
of these database files: supported rectilinear distortion/TCA calibrations
and camera identifiers are extracted to JSON; unsupported models and
vignetting samples are omitted. That generated data retains CC BY-SA 3.0.
OpenLR's renderer and transform implementation are separate project code.
